{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2694\ufe0f Souls Like Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience top-tier combat powered by a refined stamina system, where every attack, smooth i-frame dodge rolls, and versatile defensive mechanics (parry, deflect, block) based on precise keypress timing demand flawless execution. Face brutal boss fights that push your skills to the absolute limit. Seal your victories with stunning enemy finishers, delivering the ultimate thrill of triumph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/extras/6949408315cc71d431e6acfa8093ab9d.avif?t=1769000649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 Stealth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the shadows in heart-pounding stealth mechanics, where vigilant enemies detect your presence through piercing vision cones, the faintest footsteps or actions producing noise, and even the slightest damage alerting them to your location\u2014demanding precision, patience, and perfect timing to remain unseen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/extras/fe541cb925539852b9f3b8999fa8321f.avif?t=1769000649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Diverse Enemy AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against diverse and intelligent enemy AI: Guards patrol tactically with precise attacks and parries, plus realistic hit reactions; Zombies move chaotically in hordes with frenzied, gruesome assaults; Bosses feature complex patterns across phases, brutal combos, sturdy defenses, and spectacular reactions\u2014demanding perfect strategy to emerge victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/extras/680ce48072142b14d053e08afccdeded.avif?t=1769000649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/extras/e2c31653e95cb8f8621f5d193f982a66.avif?t=1769000649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> woven into the narrative, uncovering crucial clues that bring you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/extras/2816b53ca5f4516a27688bd32d9ccea8.avif?t=1769000649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107790?t=1769000649","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107790?t=1769000649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/cd7c84adebd2ca32b28a7c78fa646e89ded40e8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769000649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107790/cd7c84adebd2ca32b28a7c78fa646e89ded40e8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769000649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2694\ufe0f Souls Like Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience top-tier combat powered by a refined stamina system, where every attack, smooth i-frame dodge rolls, and versatile defensive mechanics (parry, deflect, block) based on precise keypress timing demand flawless exec